-          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.3.11-8">* CallId, the CallId for the call the connection belongs to.</t>
-          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.3.11-9">* NotifiedEntity, the current &quot;notified entity&quot; for the Connection.
-  Note this is the same as the &quot;notified entity&quot; for the endpoint
