-  parameters for the connection.</t>
-          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.3.11-15">If no info was requested and the EndpointId is valid, the gateway
+          <ul spacing="normal" indent="3" bare="false" empty="false" pn="section-2.3.11-8">
+            <li pn="section-2.3.11-8.1">CallId, the CallId for the call the connection belongs to.</li>
+            <li pn="section-2.3.11-8.2">NotifiedEntity, the current &quot;notified entity&quot; for the Connection.
+Note this is the same as the &quot;notified entity&quot; for the endpoint
+(included here for backwards compatibility).</li>
+            <li pn="section-2.3.11-8.3">LocalConnectionOptions, the most recent LocalConnectionOptions
