-        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.4-17">401 The phone is already off hook.</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.4-18">402 The phone is already on hook.</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.4-19">403 The transaction could not be executed, because the endpoint does
-    not have sufficient resources at this time.</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.4-20">404 Insufficient bandwidth at this time.</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.4-21">405 The transaction could not be executed, because the endpoint is
